== Developer Notes ==

- The gallery images are stored as post meta under the key `_at_gallery_images`.
- You can use `wp_get_attachment_image()` to display images in the gallery or customize the output to fit your theme's needs.
- The plugin is fully extendable. You can modify the display template by overriding the template in your theme if needed.

